        {
          "text": "Kotema Elisa atiar, “Kopupokisi akirot naka EJAKAIT: inera EJAKAIT kwanata ebe, Moi kwape tinenikwana egwelario aitemis naka akiria nuidieie esekel, * ka aitemisio aarei nuka esairi esekel, korute loka Samaria.’ ",
