        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodi ekapolon loagonanakin ekabaka akanike aboŋokin etuŋanan loka Edeke ebe, “Koany, arai kiswama EJAKAIT apedon toma akuj, tikepedoo akirot nin ajaut?” Kotema atiar, “Koany, ianyuni kakonikonye konye mam inyami.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
