            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naarai abu EJAKAIT kisiira aiore naka Isurian aruo naka agalin, ka aruo naka ibalasin, aruo naka aiore naepol: kotemanaros atiar, “Koany, ebooleikis ekabaka loka Isirael ikabakan luka Ikitin ka ikabakan luka Imisirian aitiji oni,” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
