              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kopotu kiworoto ekagolon loka ere: kolimonokis kes ebe, “Kidolo isio oidukurun luka Isurian, ido koany, amamei etuŋanan, karaida eporoto loka ituŋanan, konye ibalasin eenen, ka asigirian eenen, ka iweman da kwape kwaŋin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konyarau ikagolok; kolimokis lukokal loka ekabaka lukotoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konyou ekabaka kuare, kotema ikekeiaanakinak atiar, “Kekwenyari yes nukiswamakis Isurian oni. Ejenete kesi ebe kiriebi oni eteŋei; kanuka nun ŋes alomariata koidukurun aiŋop ais, kobalas ebe, ‘Kelomut kore, kanatasi ejarete, kilomari do ore.’’’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koboŋok ediopet kokeiaanakinakake kotema atiar, “Kenainait, koyanaasi icetuŋa ibalasin ikany luedeunos, luesalito ore, (koany, esubito kesi bala ekodet kere loka Isirael loedeun kaŋes; koany, esubito bala ekodet kere loka Isirael loamudiar r) keiukasi, kaanyutu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodete koyanaasi agalin aarei kibalasin; kijuka ekabaka atupar aiore naka Isurian, kobala ebe, “Koloto, koanyut.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kibwapakis kes aitodol Yorodan: ido koany, eleleba erot inapen ka iboro, luacakanarete Isurian iwonyete, Kobonut ikiyakia, kolimokis ekabaka,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
