        {
          "text": "Kodakak ekabaka ekapolon loagona* esekel ŋes apesa nakin ekabaka akanike apolokin erute: kicakacakata ituŋa ŋes korute, kotwana kwape abalar etuŋanan loka Edeke, loenera kelot ekabaka mama ejai. ",
