              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodi kanen, kwape abalar etuŋanan loka Edeke ekabaka ebe, “Aitemisio aarei nuka esairi esekel, ka aitemis naka akiria nuidicie esekel, ejaun kwaŋin korute loka Samaria moi kwape tinenikwana.’ ",
